            "detailed_description": "<h1>BLASPHEMOUS 2 - OUT NOW</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774361/extras/9989595834da53d94eeb04ae799892d5.avif?t=1780479368\" width=616 height=352 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Edição Deluxe digital</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774361/extras/c616b72f8b3b33b4d7ff732121c706f2.avif?t=1780479368\" width=616 height=616 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive the base game, original soundtrack, artbook, digital comic and 'Alloy of Sin' alternative skin!</p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >O reino de Cvstodia e os seus habitantes foram envolvidos por uma tenebrosa maldição conhecida simplesmente como O Milagre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entra na pele do Penitente - o único sobrevivente do massacre do &quot;Lamento Silencioso&quot;. Preso num eterno ciclo de morte e renascimento, terás de libertar o mundo deste terrível destino e encontrar a origem de toda esta angústia. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explora um retorcido pesadelo religioso e descobre os seus inúmeros segredos. Aplica combos devastadores e execuções brutais para aniquilar hordas de monstros grotescos e bosses titânicos preparados a desmembrar-te. Localiza e equipa relíquias, rosários e orações para obter ajuda dos poderes divinos enquanto tentas libertar o mundo da danação eterna.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Principais caraterísticas:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explora um mundo não linear:</strong> Domina inimigos temíveis e armadilhas mortíferas enquanto percorres todo o tipo de cenários e buscas a redenção no tenebroso mundo gótico de Cvstodia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774361/extras/beb8730c4086a6e62a58c4c395e4e154.poster.avif?t=1780479368\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774361/extras/beb8730c4086a6e62a58c4c395e4e154.webm?t=1780479368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774361/extras/beb8730c4086a6e62a58c4c395e4e154.mp4?t=1780479368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combate brutal: </strong>Mostra todo o poder da Mea Culpa, uma espada nascida da própria culpa e pronta a estraçalhar os teus inimigos. Obtém novos combos devastadores e golpes especiais à medida que exterminas todos aqueles que cruzarem o teu caminho.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774361/extras/a11f07eecfe7ccd187ae9b81cffe727a.poster.avif?t=1780479368\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774361/extras/a11f07eecfe7ccd187ae9b81cffe727a.webm?t=1780479368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774361/extras/a11f07eecfe7ccd187ae9b81cffe727a.mp4?t=1780479368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Execuções:</strong> Liberta a tua fúria e diverte-te com o violento desmembramento dos teus inimigos - que ganha vida graças a animações pixelizadas belíssimas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774361/extras/8b20b2526b84ea57bdf9c3143537c492.poster.avif?t=1780479368\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774361/extras/8b20b2526b84ea57bdf9c3143537c492.webm?t=1780479368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774361/extras/8b20b2526b84ea57bdf9c3143537c492.mp4?t=1780479368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personaliza a tua personagem:</strong> Descobre e equipa Relíquias, Rosários, Orações e Corações de Espada, cujas habilidades e reforços de estatísticas vais precisar para sobreviver. Experimenta várias combinações consoante o teu estilo de jogo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774361/extras/eaccac7e2448c289c84060693a64a657.poster.avif?t=1780479368\" width=616 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774361/extras/eaccac7e2448c289c84060693a64a657.webm?t=1780479368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774361/extras/eaccac7e2448c289c84060693a64a657.mp4?t=1780479368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combates épicos contra bosses:</strong> Hordas de colossais e retorcidas criaturas bloqueiam o teu caminho. Aprende os seus movimentos, sobrevive aos seus devastadores ataques e triunfa.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774361/extras/19bc6758ba0cf580357b3a5b78098db9.poster.avif?t=1780479368\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774361/extras/19bc6758ba0cf580357b3a5b78098db9.webm?t=1780479368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774361/extras/19bc6758ba0cf580357b3a5b78098db9.mp4?t=1780479368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Desvenda os mistérios de Cvstodia:</strong> O mundo está cheio de almas atormentadas. Algumas irão auxiliar-te, outras pedirão algo em troca. Descobre as histórias e destinos destas personagens torturadas para obter recompensas e compreender melhor o tenebroso mundo que habitas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774361/extras/b9458102db887dca1890311f1080b33c.poster.avif?t=1780479368\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774361/extras/b9458102db887dca1890311f1080b33c.webm?t=1780479368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774361/extras/b9458102db887dca1890311f1080b33c.mp4?t=1780479368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
